  "notes": [
    "**Ver** is irregular in all tenses",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (veo), shortened forms for tú/él/ellos (ves, ve, ven)",
    "Preterite: irregular with no accents and shortened forms (vi, vio)",
    "Imperfect: irregular stem \"ve-\" with accents (veía, veías, etc.)",
    "Irregular past participle: **visto** (seen) - used in perfect tenses: *he visto* (I have seen)",
    "Common usage: *ver la televisión* (to watch TV), *ver una película* (to watch a movie)",
    "Don't confuse with **mirar** (to look at deliberately) - **ver** is perceiving/seeing"
  ],
